# Dashboard/admin UI

When changing dashboard/admin UI, use the relevant sections of [the dashboard style contract](../../docs/inspinia-dashboard-style.md) for shell structure, asset order, theme attributes, components, and typography. It also applies when Python generates dashboard markup or payloads.

For SCSS/shared asset changes, run `npm run build`. See `inspinia/static/AGENTS.md` for generated and vendored asset boundaries.
